message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BCI Security Gateway"
abstract: >-
  Prototype inline security gateway for a brain-computer interface streaming
  pipeline. It enforces mutual TLS authentication with a device allowlist,
  HMAC-SHA256 integrity protection, timestamp and sequence anti-replay, input
  validation, and behavioural monitoring through per-device rate limiting and
  statistical channel anomaly detection. Evaluated against six attack scenarios
  across thirteen variants, measured on both an undefended baseline pipeline and
  the gateway-protected pipeline. MSc Cybersecurity thesis artifact.
